'' 'new T3( 3, 4, 5 )' over 'T3 extends T2 extends T1' fills T1.i, T2.j, T3.k -- a base whose
'' argument is not of its own type is entered (structs/udt-upcast-2.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/new-base-field-list.bas -o tests/codegen/newbasefieldlist.exe
